/**
 * Stackra file contract:
 * Purpose: the whole Lucide set of `lucide-react-native` as one registry keyed by `IconName`: the opt-in for an app that
 *          wants every icon.
 * Boundary: importing it puts every icon in the bundle, about 180 KB gzipped on web; an app that cares registers
 *          only the icons it uses. Generated by `scripts/generate-icons.mjs` from the installed Lucide set: do not
 *          edit, run `pnpm --filter @stackra/icons generate` after a Lucide bump.
 * Runtime: react-native
 * Governing contract: ADR 0303 (decision 10); ADR 0183 (budgets).
 */
